# Environment variables for the adaptive agent harness.
#
# Milestone 0 needs NO environment variables. Everything below is commented out
# and listed only so the required names are discoverable ahead of time. Copy
# this file to `.env` and fill values in when the milestone that introduces them
# starts. Never commit `.env`.

# --- Milestone 1: AI SDK / Vercel AI Gateway -------------------------------
# The AI Gateway authenticates with Vercel OIDC or with this key. Nothing in the
# repository reads it yet: as of M1-T2 no code calls a model, and `eve info` and
# `eve build` both run without it.
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# --- Milestone 1: the example agent ----------------------------------------
# The AI Gateway model id that apps/example-agent uses (agent/agent.ts). Leave
# it unset to take eve's own default for a scaffolded project,
# `openai/gpt-5.6-luna-fast`. This is a model id, not a credential.
# EXAMPLE_AGENT_MODEL=openai/gpt-5.6-luna-fast

# --- Milestone 2: Supabase -------------------------------------------------
# Not used until M2.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Server-side only. Never expose to a client or an agent tool.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
